<title>USA: Walden holders approve merger with UST.</title>
<headline>Walden holders approve merger with UST.</headline>
<dateline>ACTON, Mass. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walden Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday its shareholders voted to approve its acquisition by UST Corp.</p>
<p>The transaction, to be accounted as a pooling of interests, is structured as a tax-free exchange of 1.9 UST common shares for each Walden share, the company said.</p>
<p>The Federal Reserve approved the merger on December 2, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
